{"version":"2.0","class":"dataset","label":"13126: Employees, jobs and remuneration in cash by industry division (17 groups), by industry (SIC2007), preliminary and final figures, contents and month","source":"Statistics Norway","updated":"2026-05-26T06:00:00Z","note":["Due to a technical error in the production, the final figures for employees and jobs for June 2021 were too low. The figures were updated on 25th May 2022. About 5,300 more employees and 8,150 additional jobs were published.  \nDuring the production of the final figures for April 2022 and the preliminary figures for May 2022, a small portion of the population was not counted. They were later added to the population and the figures where updated om 28th July 2022. The final figures for April 2022 had an addition of about 2,000 employees and 2,900 jobs. The preliminary numbers for May 2022 had an addition of about 2,400 employees and 2,300 jobs.","Tables 13161, 13126 and 13630 were updated with new figures for average remuneration in cash on November 9th 2022. It is the seasonally adjusted and unadjusted final figures that have been updated, not the preliminary. Not all remuneration in cash was included in the original figures, so an update was necessary. When all remuneration in cash are included, the seasonally adjusted average rises by an average of NOK 770 per month, but the development over time is roughly the same as previously published.","Series where a seasonal pattern cannot be identified will not be seasonally adjusted. This applies to Unspecified industries."],"role":{"time":["Tid"],"metric":["ContentsCode"]},"id":["NACE2007","ForelopigEndelig","ContentsCode","Tid"],"size":[1,1,2,62],"dimension":{"NACE2007":{"label":"industry (SIC2007)","category":{"index":{"00-99":0},"label":{"00-99":"All industries"}},"extension":{"elimination":true,"eliminationValueCode":"00-99","show":"code_value"},"link":{"describedby":[{"extension":{"NACE2007":"urn:ssb:classification:klass:6"}}]}},"ForelopigEndelig":{